# Copy to .env.spiderfoot-keys (or set these directly in Portainer's
# "Environment variables" UI) and fill in real values. Never commit real
# values — this file is a name reference only.

# --- Bundled PostgreSQL ---
SPIDERFOOT_DB=spiderfoot
SPIDERFOOT_DB_USER=spiderfoot
SPIDERFOOT_DB_PASSWORD=changeme_secure_postgres_password

# --- SpiderFoot module API keys (SF__<MODULE>__<OPTION> naming) ---
# Example:
# SF__SFP_SHODAN__API_KEY=
# SF__SFP_VIRUSTOTAL__API_KEY=
# See OSINT_API_KEYS_REFERENCE.md for the full list this project supports.
